    },
    "body": "Fix after the second `--apply`. That run moved `~/uor-r4-local/workspace` (the runner's shared work area, 6.6 GB) to the Trash once its newest file dropped below its iCloud upload time; it was restored immediately. The script now skips `workspace` by name and any folder holding a `.keep-local` marker. Dry run with the idle window set to 0 lists both workspace folders as kept.\n\nReferences #2037\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
